<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark Jan 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark Jan 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Dresdner Kleinwort Benson (books), Bayerische Hypothekenbank, Bayerische Vereinsbank, Commerzbank and Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK FRANKFURT</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.50	MATURITY    15.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE  S-09.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+18 BP</p>
<p> NOTES   ** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>		S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    =	   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    7 BP	SELL CONC  18 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND BOBL 121</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
